{# Part 2: who keeps the journal. The persona's brief, so the summary sounds like it; the stage's gist and road, so it
   agrees with what has passed; and the news new to it since the last meeting, by short, with its certainty word. #}
[ system ]
About {{ name }}: {{ brief }}{% if not empty(honesty) %} Honesty: {{ honesty }}.{% endif %}
{% if not (empty(gist) and empty(road)) %}Where things stand now: {{ gist }} {{ road }}{% endif %}
{% if not empty(new_world) %}
News that reached {{ name }} since the last meeting: {{ join(new_world, "; ") }}.
{% endif %}
